      "blockType": "Source",
      "rawSource": "\nFor \u0026DVelop_MenuItem in \u0026DVelop_Menu\n\tIf \u0026DVelop_MenuItem.link = \u0026LinkToFind\n\t\t\u0026FontIcon = \u0026DVelop_MenuItem.iconClass\n\t\tExit\n\tElse\n\t\t\u0026FontIcon = GetBookmarkFontIcon(\u0026LinkToFind, \u0026DVelop_MenuItem.subItems)\n\t\tIf \u0026FontIcon \u003C\u003E \u0027\u0027\n\t\t\tExit\n\t\tEndIf\n\tEndIf\nEndFor\n",
      "cleanSource": "\nFor \u0026DVelop_MenuItem in \u0026DVelop_Menu\n\tIf \u0026DVelop_MenuItem.link = \u0026LinkToFind\n\t\t\u0026FontIcon = \u0026DVelop_MenuItem.iconClass\n\t\tExit\n\tElse\n\t\t\u0026FontIcon = GetBookmarkFontIcon(\u0026LinkToFind, \u0026DVelop_MenuItem.subItems)\n\t\tIf \u0026FontIcon \u003C\u003E \u0027\u0027\n\t\t\tExit\n\t\tEndIf\n\tEndIf\nEndFor"
